  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGO provision of Emergency Assistance to populations affected by violence in North and South Kivus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity NGO provision of Emergency Assistance to populations affected by violence in North and South Kivus is a component of Provision of Lifesaving Humanitarian Assistance to vulnerable individuals and households affected by violence in Eastern Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;4,575,189. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services, Emergency food assistance, Relief co-ordination and support services.</narrative>
  </description>
